    <briefdescription>
<para>Tracking metadata reference owned by <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_metadata" kindref="compound">Metadata</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Similar to <emphasis><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_tracking_m_d_ref" kindref="compound">TrackingMDRef</ref></emphasis>, but it&apos;s expected to be owned by an instance of <emphasis><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_metadata" kindref="compound">Metadata</ref></emphasis>, which has the option of registering itself for callbacks to re-unique itself.</para>
<para>In particular, this is used by <emphasis><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_m_d_node" kindref="compound">MDNode</ref></emphasis>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
